# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"
msgstr "Instala `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"
msgstr "Sigue estos pasos para instalar `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` repository.\n"
msgstr "Clona el repositorio `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Cambia al directorio `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "Instala `qiskit-runtime`. Te recomendamos usar un [entorno virtual](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) para evitar contaminar tu instalación global de Python.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Instalación estándar**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr "**Modo editable**: En este modo, no necesitas reinstalar Qiskit cuando hay cambios de código en el proyecto.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ without optimizations.\n"
msgstr "    En modo editable, las extensiones compiladas se construyen en _modo de depuración_ sin optimizaciones.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer requirements. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "(Opcional) Si quieres ejecutar pruebas o comprobaciones de linting, instala los requisitos de desarrollo. Te recomendamos usar un [entorno virtual](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) para evitar contaminar tu instalación global de Python.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos pasos {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendaciones\">\n"
"  - Lee las [pautas de contribución](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) para contribuir a `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Instala el SDK de Qiskit desde el código fuente](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Ejecuta tu primer programa](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Prueba un tutorial, como [el algoritmo de Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
